--[[
    Toilet Hub (トイレットハブ) - Modified Version

    This script is an enhanced version of the original orbiting tool for
    the Roblox game “Fling Things and People”.  It includes the same
    orbiting functionality with various shapes and parameters, but with
    additional improvements:

      • A more robust third‑person camera toggle.  When enabled, the
        script enforces third‑person view every frame to combat other
        scripts or game settings that might override it.  Disabling the
        toggle returns to first‑person.
      • Teleporting toilets now permanently assigns network ownership of
        each toilet to the local player.  This allows you to fully
        control the toilets after teleporting without the server reclaiming
        ownership.

    See the original script for more details on usage.  Only the parts
    needed to address the user’s requests have been modified.
]]

-- Services
